title: temprun visible parallel fanout
date: 2026-08-29
status: settled

claims:
  - id: demo-fanout-must-be-visually-obvious
    text: During the simulated fan-out phase, the UI highlights split/merge lanes, labels the run status as 6 parallel, and animates each active agent card.

changes:
  - Added a fanout-running state to the workflow visualization.
  - Highlighted split and merge connectors while agent Activities are running.
  - Added per-agent progress animation during each simulated Activity attempt.
  - Slowed simulated attempt durations enough that all six parallel agents are visible together.

verification:
  - PYTHONPATH=. .venv311/bin/python -m pytest
  - node --check docs/app.js
  - Playwright interaction check captured all six agents active during fan-out with no horizontal overflow.
